            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 1751,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"f2b945ba-4759-4a80-9d8e-775606be7973\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"The cat slowly blinks and turns its head toward the window.\",\"model_prompt\":\"How the reference pictures align with the target video - Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 2.00-second mark of the target video.\\n\\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot begins with the white heterochromia cat sitting upright in the outdoor grass exactly as shown in Picture 1, preserving its pose, fur texture, and lighting. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward the cat's face as it slowly lowers its eyelids, blinks, and rotates its head forward to match the close-up framing, centered eye alignment, and direct gaze established in Picture 2 at the end of the shot.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Soft rustling of grass blades moving against the cat's fur, accompanied by a faint outdoor breeze.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":2520,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3\",\"task_type\":\"I2V\",\"seed\":748584,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":2.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat2.jpg\",\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat1.jpg\"],\"input_video_secs\":null,\"src_video_urls\":null,\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
